# Voyager Monorepo — Overview

This repository is a monorepo that contains a macOS SwiftUI app (frontend) and a Python FastAPI service (backend).

## Repository layout

- macOS app root: [apps/macos/Voyager/](mdc:apps/macos/Voyager)
- Frontend entry: [apps/macos/Voyager/Voyager/VoyagerApp.swift](mdc:apps/macos/Voyager/Voyager/VoyagerApp.swift)
- Helper/launcher: [apps/macos/Voyager/VoyagerHelper/VoyagerHelperApp.swift](mdc:apps/macos/Voyager/VoyagerHelper/VoyagerHelperApp.swift)

- Backend root: [apps/backend/](mdc:apps/backend)
- Backend entry: [apps/backend/src/app/main.py](mdc:apps/backend/src/app/main.py)
- Backend CLI: [apps/backend/src/app/cli.py](mdc:apps/backend/src/app/cli.py)
- Backend config loader: [apps/backend/src/app/config.py](mdc:apps/backend/src/app/config.py)
- Environment configs: `.env.dev`, `.env.prod`, `.env.source`, `.env.bundled` (project root)

## How to run (high-level)

See [01-dev-run-and-env.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/01-dev-run-and-env.mdc) for detailed development workflows and environment setup.

## Language policy

- Rules are written in English.
- Code comments are written in Korean.
- Conversations in the project are in Korean unless specified.

## Rule numbering system

- `00-09`: Monorepo overview and cross-cutting concerns
- `10-19`: Frontend (SwiftUI + TCA) specific rules
- `20-29`: Backend (FastAPI + Python) specific rules
- `90-99`: Agent mode and governance

## Notes

- Paths in rules and examples use absolute-style monorepo paths (e.g., `apps/backend/...`, `apps/macos/...`).
- See [04-security-and-secrets.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/04-security-and-secrets.mdc) for secrets management guidelines.
